# Routing

Use Atomic Router.

## Rules

- Do not use React Router.
- Do not introduce another routing solution.
- Work independently within the established routing architecture: add or update routes required by the task using existing project conventions, without requesting separate approval.
- Do not introduce or change the routing architecture unless explicitly requested.
- Keep routing connected to Effector where appropriate.

## Ownership

The project owner defines the routing architecture. When it already exists, follow it without requesting confirmation for routine changes within that architecture.

When the routing architecture is absent, or the task requires changing it beyond the authorized scope, ask for clarification instead of inventing a new architecture.
